# Built with GNU tools on Windows; keep LF everywhere so the Makefiles, the
# generated KiCad files and the shell snippets are the same on every side.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
# kit/: what the project hands over (tools/make_kit.py). The builds byte for byte (their sha256
# are in BUILD.txt); the Windows launchers with CRLF, the macOS ones with LF (bash stops at a CR)
kit/2_flash/**/*.fs -text
kit/2_flash/**/*.bin binary
kit/**/*.bat text eol=crlf
kit/**/*.command text eol=lf
